hen the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initializer succeeds.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example converts the position of the Unicode scalar ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"e\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"into its corresponding position in the string. The character at that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"position is the composed ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"é\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" character.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let cafe = \"Cafe\\u{0301}\"","print(cafe)","\/\/ Prints \"Café\"","","let scalarsIndex = cafe.unicodeScalars.firstIndex(of: \"e\")!","let stringIndex = String.Index(scalarsIndex, within: cafe)!","","print(cafe[...stringIndex])","\/\/ Prints \"Café\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the index passed as ","type":"text"},{"code":"sourcePosition","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" doesn’t have an exact","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"corresponding position in ","type":"text"},{"code":"target","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the result of the initializer is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For example, an attempt to convert the position of the combining","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"acute accent (","type":"text"},{"code":"\"\\u{0301}\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") fails. Combining Unicode scalars do not have","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their own position in a string.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let nextScalarsIndex = cafe.unicodeScalars.index(after: scalarsIndex)","let nextStringIndex = String.Index(nextScalarsIndex, within: cafe)","","print(nextStringIndex)","\/\/ Prints \"nil\""]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/docu